OL,3,GNEWSAPublic debate to be held over
OL,4,Ahousing controversy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public debate will be held over plans
OL,7,Fto build a new housing estate on a
OL,8,Fgreen corridor after a backlash from
OL,9,Fresidents.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council has agreed to
OL,12,Fstage an extraordinary meeting over the
OL,13,Frow surrounding proposals for a new
OL,14,F239-home estate in Newbiggin Hall after
OL,15,Fresidents voiced concerns over the
OL,16,Fpotential loss of green space.
OL,18,FHowever, the timing of the meeting has
OL,19,Fsparked concerns many residents will be
OL,20,Funable to attend.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
